  "claim": "The 2012 \"Billboard\" Music Awards were held in the same venue that the boxing match Manny Pacquiao vs. Timothy Bradley was held. It is a multi-purpose arena located within the MGM Grand Las Vegas on the Las Vegas Strip.",
