        "original_id": "9bec56e8-dd34-514c-b11c-30720b359cf8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2012 Billboard Music Awards; Manny Pacquiao vs. Timothy Bradley\n- Places: MGM Grand Garden Arena; MGM Grand Las Vegas; Las Vegas Strip; Las Vegas, Nevada; Paradise, Nevada\n- Topics: music award ceremonies; boxing matches\n\nFacts:\n- The 2012 Billboard Music Awards was a music award ceremony held on May 20, 2012, at the MGM Grand Garden Arena in Las Vegas, Nevada.\n- Manny Pacquiao vs. Timothy Bradley, billed as \"Perfect Storm,\" was a welterweight title boxing match held on June 9, 2012, at the MGM Grand Garden Arena in Paradise, Nevada.\n- The MGM Grand Garden Arena, originally known as the MGM Grand Garden Special Events Center, is a multi-purpose arena located within the MGM Grand Las Vegas on the Las Vegas Strip.",
